      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "aus, bei, mit, nach, seit, von and zu always take the dative. Sing them to the Blue Danube: aus-bei-mit-nach-seit-von-zu.",
        "gegenüber and ab take the dative too. They sit beside the song.",
        "Short forms: beim, vom, zum, zur. bei der and von der do not contract.",
        "Traps: nach Hause is the way home, zu Hause is the place. seit wants the dative. zum Arzt is a person; ins Krankenhaus is a building."
      ],
