      "title": "Immer Dativ",
      "practice": "choose",
      "heroTitle": "Seven prepositions, one case",
      "heroImage": "stethoscope",
      "story": [
        "These seven always take the <b>dative</b>: aus, bei, mit, nach, seit, von, zu. The Blue Danube waltz has seven beats for them: <b>aus-bei-mit-nach-seit-von-zu</b>.",
        "<b>gegenüber</b> and <b>ab</b> take the dative too. They do not fit the song, so learn them beside it.",
        "Short forms: bei + dem = <b>beim</b>, von + dem = <b>vom</b>, zu + dem = <b>zum</b>, zu + der = <b>zur</b>. <i>bei der</i> and <i>von der</i> stay long."
      ],
      "questionRule": "Position 1 is the subject. Position 2 is the verb. The dative phrase follows. <b>in</b> is not in this list: ins Krankenhaus is a two-way preposition.",
